' =====================================================================
' Lua refresh contract — quick reference
' =====================================================================

note as N1 #FFF7ED
  **Lua refresh script** (one-liner equivalent):

  if redis.call("GET", KEYS[1]) == ARGV[1] then
      return redis.call("EXPIRE", KEYS[1], ARGV[2])
  else
      return 0
  end

  Returns 1 if extended, 0 if lost ownership.
  Atomic via Redis EVAL (no separate watch/multi
  needed).

  **Sweep latency bounds**:
   * Best:   sweep_interval (~30s) after lock TTL expires
   * Worst:  sweep_interval + lock_TTL (~90s)
   * Backup_monitor catches anything still orphaned
     after that via the heartbeat-stale path.
end note

